  <notes>Spec FR-15; notes/word-comment-export-gap.md is the authoritative root-cause map. Shares the relabel source with the gutter — the "do it once, both win" design.

COMPLETED 2026-07-31 (sonnet/high, FULL rigor). Full execution record: notes/052-execution-notes.md.
SEAM DECISION: export-mapping seam confirmed (POML default) — composes in composeSessionCommentThreadsToAnchoredComments (LIVE save path) + composeCommentThreadsToDocxAnnotations (legacy sibling, updated for consistency), NOT at placeAdvisoryComments-time, so the gutter keeps raw fields for its own styled/interactive rendering (risk badge, clickable Standard popover).
DELIVERED: new shared helper src/client/shared/Spaarke.Compose.Components/src/widgets/advisoryNoteFormatting.ts (isAdvisoryCommentThread / getAdvisoryNoteSegments / composeAdvisoryCommentExportText — hoisted from ComposeCommentGutter.tsx's local label map + parseAdvisoryNote, now the ONE source both gutter + export consume); ComposeCommentThreadModel gains flaggedClause/assessment/standardText (scope-lift documented at the field-group doc comment); ComposeEditorProps gains advisoryCommentAuthor (default 'AI Advisory Review', threaded through useComposeCommentThreads, replacing the ComposeEditor.tsx:2196 hardcoded literal); AdvisoryCommentInput + ComposeCommentThreadMetadata gain the same 3 fields, additively threaded through placeAdvisoryComments/createThread.
TESTS (NEW): advisoryNoteFormatting.test.ts, ComposeCommentThread.exportMirror.test.ts (mapping-level: discrete-field composition, legacy degrade both marker and no-marker, plain-comment passthrough, save-reopen round-trip, durable-recall parity fixture), ComposeEditor.advisoryCommentAuthor.test.tsx (real-editor author-config proof, kept separate from the DEF-01-affected advisoryComments suite).
